{"municipality_code":"11442","pref":"埼玉県","city":"宮代町","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"宮代町には、百間村、中島村、蓮谷村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「山崎山遺跡」、「西光院」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、百間村や中島村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 ゆかりの人物では島村盛助に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「東武動物公園」や「はらっぱーく宮代」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":6,"rank":1433,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":1,"rank":1311,"percentile":22.8,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":44,"rank":556,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":4,"rank":1499,"percentile":15.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":13,"rank":1029,"percentile":44.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["島村盛助"],